      "name": "doors_and_switches_symbols",
      "source": "KINDS\n[\n#thing\n#door is a #thing\n#switch is a #thing\n].\nDEFINE\n[\n@north door is a #door\n@light switch is a #switch\n].\nSTART\n[\n@north door is closed\nPLAYER has 3 speed\n].\nWHEN PLAYER touches @light switch\n[\n|then (change @north door to open\n].\nIF @north door is closed\n[\n|then (change @light switch to glowing\n].\nOTHERWISE\n[\n|then (change @light switch to dark\n].\n",
      "expected_symbols": {
